WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:13.200
Hi, welcome back to the meditations for
this middle of the sun lam rim retreat.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.360
And we've reached the fourth meditation
which you will be doing during the

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:26.760
fourth week. You'll be doing it during
episodes 10 to 12 if I'm correct right?

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:32.760
And... so you'll be doing it that week that
you're studying episodes 10 to 12. And we

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:37.520
are continuing with the chapter--the
tenth chapter, from Master Shantideva--

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:44.960
which is called the chapter on
dedication. BSNGO BA'I LE'U. And we are

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:51.560
in the fourth section of that
meditation. Now, don't forget what Master

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:58.040
Shantideva is doing with that section--
he's dedicating a good karma. What good

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:01.240
karma?

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.780
Of finishing the book okay?

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:07.400
 So the
tenth chapter is the dedication of the

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:13.800
writing the first nine chapters. It's
kind of cool. So he's done this good

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:19.000
karma.... he's got this big pile of good
karma. You know, sometimes you get a

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:25.600
unexpected profit from your business you
know? It happens. It happens to me from

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:31.040
time to time, and I suddenly I get this
big amount of money and then

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:36.800
and then you have to think of how you're
going to give it away. So you can

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:41.920
feel that with Master Shantideva here.
He's like got this big good

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:47.040
karma landed in his hands of writing the
Guide to the Bodhisattvas Way of Life--

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:51.200
and now he's going to have to... he wants to
give it away because he wants to protect

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:55.420
it. So he wants to give that good karma
to other people.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.800
So we're in the fourth

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:05.000
part of that, and you and me we're going to
try to emulate Shantideva. We're going to

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.360
think of some good karma we did--and
this lam rim says

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.000
that a small good

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.840
deed during a difficult time in the
world

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.034
is a big good deed.

00:02:18.034 --> 00:02:20.800
Maybe as
big as what Shantideva did you see?

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:27.440
So normally if there was no virus, being
nice to your neighbor wouldn't be such a

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:32.640
big thing but in the time of the virus
to be sweet to your neighbor, to help

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:36.358
your neighbor, that becomes a very
powerful good karma.

00:02:36.358 --> 00:02:37.440
 It's so powerful

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:43.280
that we can do an act of truth okay?
Act of truth is: we say to ourselves... in

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:50.440
our meditation we're going to say, if it's
true that I got to know the neighbor at

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:58.440
the end of my street... okay I'll tell you
secretly he was a Marine colonel

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:07.200
and he was a fundamentalist Christian
preacher together okay? And then we

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:13.240
never talked to each other before... he's
old now. But we got to such a sweet

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:18.160
relationship now, we worked on it... we both
worked on it. We didn't start out with a

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:23.000
very good relationship, but we worked on
it and the virus helped us. So I'm going to

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:28.480
dedicate this karma you know? That's the
good deed I did during the virus.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:34.640
We became quite close friends and I'm very
proud of that--that's my lam rim practice

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:37.660
for for the last few months.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.560
And I worked
on it and he worked on it I'm sure.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:48.480
So that's the good karma and then I'm going to
dedicate it. I'm going to use it. For what?

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:54.080
"If it's true that I became close friends
with my neighbor... that we didn't like

00:03:54.080 --> 00:04:00.400
each other before the virus... then should
the virus itself be sent to the middle

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:04.640
of the sun and burnt up for everybody!"
25 million degrees okay?

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:06.680
"By this act

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:10.360
of truth which could turn Niagara Falls
backwards...

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:19.040
I dedicate that act of truth to
shooting the virus into the middle of

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:23.040
sun for people on this planet." Okay so
here we go.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:27.660
Get ready for your meditation.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.840
Small smile.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.540
Relax forehead.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:41.620
Tummies in. Virus...

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:45.060
Covid tummy's pulled in a little bit.

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:49.680
Hands are comfortable... chin mudra if you like.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:54.880
Back is straight. Shoulders are back.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:57.960
And let's prepare by taking ten breaths.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:01.760
Ten long exhales, that's all.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:05.160
Very slow. Very long.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:52.400
So for this meditation, we're going to do an
act of truth.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.920
For an act of truth you

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:59.080
need some ammunition--you need a good
deed that you have done.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.300
Particularly in

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:07.740
the last few months during this world
crisis... world problem.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.360
And so let's each

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:19.640
one of us think about some special
thing that we did that was kind or nice

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.440
to someone else during the virus. We all
did something.

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:25.820
That's going to be our

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:29.300
ammunition.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:32.260
Let's think about that.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:34.860
Something nice you did during the virus

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:38.340
time. Just one is enough.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:42.000
Make it clear.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.860
Now let's dedicate that. Let's do an act
of truth.

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:54.200
If it's true that I did this

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:59.960
kindness during the virus then... and
here's a list from Shantideva. 

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:05.100
Then may there be beautiful gardens.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:10.120
Lovely gardens appear in this world.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:17.580
And people sitting in those gardens and enjoying
learning goodness.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:24.240
Dharma... learning the Dharma.
Doesn't have to be Buddhist Dharma but

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:27.780
may there come to be beautiful places...

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:30.120
maybe this is where we'll have to go

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:36.520
back to teaching Dharma in large
gardens as in the Buddha's time with

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:46.160
social distancing in the garden. And may
their appear gardens in this world. 

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:51.120
And people relaxing on the grass or on a
bench

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:56.840
speaking about lam rim.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:02.960
if it's true that I was good during the
virus

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:12.620
may there be teachings for everyone. May
everyone meet the teacher who fits them.

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:15.200
Through my good deed

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:20.080
may everyone meet the teacher who fits them.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:43.480
Now Shantideva makes a very interesting
prayer. May the economy of the world be

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.080
healthy.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:51.440
May the governments be well-managed
governments that serve their peoples

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.160
well.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.980
And of course, may the weather be good

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:01.200
and may the crops be successful and
plentiful.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.800
May we have good governance

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:08.800
around the world. May we have good
economy--world economy.

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:14.240
If I was nice during the virus.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:55.600
Shantideva next prayer is very
interesting.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:57.340
If it's true that I was good

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:06.200
during the virus to someone then may
medicines in this world be effective.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:15.160
May medicines work for people. May the
vaccine against this virus be found

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:20.160
quickly and may it work for everybody.

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.760
Very interesting prayer that Shantideva

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:28.120
made over a thousand years ago for us.

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:05.880
May no one feel pain or fear.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.960
May no one
be unhappy.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.560
May no one be hurt by another

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:13.400
person.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:40.500
Where people are studying spiritual practice,

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.440
whatever religion it may be,

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.200
may
they be successful

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.480
and may there be

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:52.000
harmony in that group. And may they do
good practice together. May all churches,

00:13:52.000 --> 00:14:00.680
mosques, temples, or even people who have
no religion, may they live in harmony.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:06.080
May their wisdom increase by my act of truth.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.980
May people believe in higher things.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:22.200
May
they learn to make offerings to

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:27.160
higher beings that they cannot see.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:34.840
May they always be reborn as a human and
may they reach enlightenment.

00:14:56.680 --> 00:15:02.000
Then there are plenty of Buddhas in the
Universe. There are countless bodhisattvas in

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.360
the universe.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:10.880
And Shantideva makes an interesting prayer--act of truth.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:17.300
Those Buddhas and bodhisattvas they have
plans for us. For you, for me, for our

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:22.440
family, for our friends, for our country.
They have plans for us. They have

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:30.240
plans in mind for us. And they may even
involve going on a lower path for a

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:40.320
while--but I dedicate the good karma of
the service I gave to others during the

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:47.440
virus that those plans should come true.
They should succeed in the plans they

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:52.400
have for me and for you. Those plans
should succeed.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:07.740
May all beings see emptiness in this
universe.

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:12.360
May all beings practice loving

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.600
each other mainly.

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:21.840
May they learn to do
deep retreat.

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:25.480
May places like Diamond Mountain

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:33.380
grow in many parts of this
world where people can go and do deep retreat.

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:37.820
 We're doing sort of a retreat
during the virus, but it's good to get

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:45.720
out of your own home and go to a special
place where people just do retreat.

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:53.880
And the buildings are built for retreat. May
those retreat centers thrive, and be

00:16:53.880 --> 00:17:02.080
healthy, and serve many people. If I have
been nice to someone during the virus...

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:07.900
try to remember the good thing you did.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:11.360
Send strong prayers to spiritual

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:15.000
communities of all religions.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.980
Pray for their success.

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:55.080
Please come back to your breath. Three
long exhales.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:12.080
Then slowly open your eyes. Take a
stretch. Yay!

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:13.920
Nice job.

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:16.000
See you in the next meditation.

